---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import appData from '../../data/apps.json';
import type {AppEntry} from '../../data/apps';
const apps = appData as AppEntry[];
---
<Base title="The Kata Tool Shed" description="Useful little apps and creative experiments from intrepion. Explore original audio tools for sound design, editing, and making." section="tools">
<section class="shed-hero wrap"><div class="shed-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE KATA TOOL SHED / OPEN TO CURIOSITY</p><h1>Good ideas.<br /><em>Handy little tools.</em></h1><p>A place for apps that help you make something, figure something out, or just try a different way.</p><a class="button shed-button" href="#apps">Open the shed <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="shed-drawing" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pegboard"></div><span class="shed-label">WORKBENCH / 001</span><div class="sound-module"><div class="module-label">SOUND / LAB <span>●</span></div><div class="module-wave">▁▂▅▇▃▂▆█▅▂▁▃▆▃▂▁</div><div class="module-controls"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><span class="shed-note">A LITTLE TWEAK.<br />A NEW POSSIBILITY.</span></div></section>
<section class="tool-list wrap" id="apps" aria-labelledby="apps-title"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">ON THE BENCH / {String(apps.length).padStart(2, '0')}</p><h2 id="apps-title">Made for <em>making.</em></h2></div><p>A growing collection of independent app experiments. Games have their own home in the <a href="/arcade/">Kata Arcade</a>.</p></div>
{apps.map(app => <article class="tool-card"><a class="tool-preview" href={`/apps/${app.id}/`} tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{app.screenshots.length ? <img src={app.screenshots[0].file} alt="" width={app.screenshots[0].width} height={app.screenshots[0].height} loading="lazy" /> : <div class="preview-wave"><span>▁▂▅▇▃▂▆█▅▂▁▃▆▃▂▁</span><small>SCREENSHOTS COMING SOON</small></div>}</a><div class="tool-card-copy"><div class="tool-tags"><span>{app.category}</span><span class="status-tag">{app.status === 'live' ? 'Ready to use' : 'Local preview'}</span></div><h3><a href={`/apps/${app.id}/`}>{app.title}</a></h3><p class="tool-tagline">{app.tagline}</p><p>{app.description}</p><p class="tool-credit">Inspired by {app.inspiration}</p><a class="button button-dark" href={`/apps/${app.id}/`}>Explore the app <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article>)}
</section><section class="shed-about wrap"><p class="eyebrow">SAME CURIOSITY, DIFFERENT DRAWER</p><h2>Apps belong here.<br />Games belong in the arcade.</h2><p>The Tool Shed gives useful experiments a place of their own. Each app gets its own project, screenshots, and room to grow.</p><a href="/arcade/" class="text-link">In the mood to play? Visit the Kata Arcade →</a></section>
</Base>
